<devicesets>
<deviceset name="143601155210" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:49062187/1" locally_modified="yes" prefix="Q">
<description>WL-OCHS SOP-5

Characteristics
Very high transmission speed - MHz to Mbit/s range
Precise shifting without much delay thanks to fast switching times
High insulation voltage VISO = 3750 &amp; 5000 VRMS
High immunity to interference (EMC)

Applications
High-speed digital signal transmission
Interface isolation (e.g., UART, SPI, RS-232, RS-485)
Switching power supplies and power electronics
Industrial controls and automation
Microcontroller and embedded systems

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/WL-OCHS-SOP-5
 
Created by Ella 2026-08-06
2026(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
